  "name": "fixedbitset",
  "description": "A minimalist Rust library providing a fixed-capacity bitset backed by a boxed slice of unsigned 32-bit integers. It offers high-performance bit manipulation with constant-time access and direct memory-slice interoperability for bulk processing. The implementation balances safety and performance through strategic use of internal unsafe blocks for unchecked memory access.",
